  <item>
    <title>10 居然能有第10期！从写小说到打工，我们半途而废的前半生</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/62f7b3e9226f5c1fa0d5877d</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">62f7b3e9226f5c1fa0d5877d</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 13 Aug 2022 14:23:37 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>天啊竟然不知不觉来到第十期！虽然不是什么特别大的数字，但对于很爱半途而废的大家来说也已经是很了不起的事情！本期节目就来讲讲那些我们放弃过的大小事。顺便许愿，希望未来我们会有更多集（吧）～</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>内容概要：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="160">2:40</a> 烂粑粑写小说</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1085">18:05</a> 草莓达人鱼子酱学钢琴</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1575">26:15</a> 冰冻芒果飞飞酱弹吉他</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2230">37:10</a> 冰冻芒果飞飞酱的打工故事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2893">48:13</a> 有一些朋友或许只能陪我们走一段</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>歌单：</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>最好的时光 - 焦安溥</span></p><span></span><p><span>第一天 - 孙燕姿</span></p><span></span><p><span>花的姿态 - 陈绮贞</span></p><span></span><p><span>有星星的晚上 - 旺福</span></p><span></span><p><span>乘客 - 王菲</span></p><span></span><p><span>秋天的海 - 苏慧伦</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果你是假的 - 王菲</span></p><span></span><p><span>Sugar Rush - Addison Grace</span></p><span></span><p><span>(It's not a crime) It's just what we do - 窦靖童</span></p><span></span><p><span>It's not the end of the world - 草莓救星</span></p><span></span><p><span>爱出发 - TFBOYS</span></p><span></span><p><span>从未到过的地方 - 王心凌</span></p><span></span><p><span>旅行的意义 - 陈绮贞</span></p><span></span><p><span>纸飞机 - 林忆莲</span></p><span></span><p><span>周梦蝶 - The Verse</span></p><span></span><p><span>黎明 - 基诺</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>天空不作美，那就一起冒雨过街吧！</span></strong></p>]]></description>
